OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist killed in crash 'made
OL,4,Alife brighter'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist who died after a
OL,7,Fcollision involving a lorry was "loved
OL,8,Fbeyond words", his family said.
OL,10,FTyler Ellis from Yaxley near
OL,11,FPeterborough, was taken to
OL,12,FAddenbrooke's Hospital, in Cambridge,
OL,13,Fwith life-threatening injuries but
OL,14,Flater died.
OL,16,FA red Volvo lorry heading northbound
OL,17,Fcollided with the 23-year-old's black
OL,18,FKawasaki, going in the opposite
OL,19,Fdirection, on the B1043 Old North Road
OL,20,Fin Sawtry, Cambridgeshire, at about
OL,21,F12:50 BST on 5 October.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
